      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Keen to see the return of unbeaten PLUNGER (1). He was dominant on debut before a tough win in the Future Stars Series Final at Pakenham, holding off Savoyard who looks a talent himself. Plenty of weight even after the claim (in an apprentice-only race) but he's jumped out well and might just end up being better than these. That's saying a bit because LYRICS 'N' SONG (8) boasts a Listed placing. She clearly didn't handle the heavy going first up at Geelong, beaten out of sight as the $1.55 favourite. Will get better conditions here and can bounce right back. ZOURAIN (2) has probably hit his mark but has pieces of form that warrant plenty of respect here. SMART LITTLE MISS (9) next best.",
